WEBVTT

00:14.014 --> 00:15.181
Genya!

00:41.499 --> 00:44.502
Demon Slayer: Swordsmith Village Arc

01:58.118 --> 02:02.956
Episode 6:
Aren't You Going to Be a Hashira?

02:17.971 --> 02:19.597
Genya?

02:23.268 --> 02:25.937
What was that attack?

02:26.020 --> 02:28.189
-I can't regenerate!
-Our attacks are working.

02:28.273 --> 02:30.441
-It burns!
-Shut up! You're shameful!

02:30.525 --> 02:32.986
It's slow, but we're regenerating!

02:34.529 --> 02:39.117
I don't know what happened to Genya,
but I now know something thanks to him.

02:39.200 --> 02:42.120
I'm afraid even if we cut all four heads
at the same time,

02:42.203 --> 02:44.789
we can't defeat them
like Gyutaro and his sister.

02:46.457 --> 02:50.336
There's almost no point attacking
these four emotion demons.

02:51.880 --> 02:52.922
Nezuko!

02:54.215 --> 02:55.633
Nezuko!

03:00.722 --> 03:01.848
Nezuko!

03:05.226 --> 03:08.021
I've been wondering about
something for a while.

03:10.148 --> 03:12.734
Is it possible that their necks
aren't the weak point?

03:14.027 --> 03:17.739
I started to suspect
when I smelled it for a moment.

03:18.656 --> 03:20.450
Right. It was…

03:21.075 --> 03:22.660
the smell of a fifth one!

03:23.912 --> 03:25.246
There's a fifth body!

03:25.872 --> 03:27.040
I have to find it.

03:27.874 --> 03:29.959
The fifth's neck must be somewhere!

03:32.378 --> 03:33.963
Don't get cocky!

03:34.047 --> 03:37.842
I'm the one who's gonna defeat
the Upper Rank!

03:37.926 --> 03:38.927
Genya…

03:39.427 --> 03:42.972
It wasn't your strength alone
that beat Upper Rank Six!

03:43.056 --> 03:46.059
That's why you haven't become a Hashira!

03:46.142 --> 03:47.685
Yeah, that's right.

03:47.769 --> 03:53.316
Before you can, I will…

03:53.399 --> 03:56.486
Genya, you're drooling.
What happened to you?

03:56.569 --> 03:58.571
You're choking me too.

03:59.989 --> 04:01.824
I'm the one who's gonna be a Hashira!

04:02.325 --> 04:04.661
I see. I get it now.

04:04.744 --> 04:06.955
Nezuko and I will support you
to the fullest!

04:07.038 --> 04:08.581
Let's do our best together!

04:09.916 --> 04:12.001
There must be a fifth demon.

04:12.085 --> 04:14.420
I'll find it. Could you buy me some time?

04:14.504 --> 04:17.048
I know your tricks!

04:17.131 --> 04:19.425
Getting me to drop my guard and…

04:25.723 --> 04:26.724
Watch out!

04:32.563 --> 04:34.607
The anger demon is back already.

04:34.691 --> 04:36.025
We have to hurry.

04:36.109 --> 04:36.943
Genya!

04:37.652 --> 04:39.612
I'll tell you
when I find the fifth one.

04:39.696 --> 04:41.489
Please hold that one off for a while!

04:42.824 --> 04:44.867
They've all regenerated already.

04:46.703 --> 04:49.122
Just be careful not to attack Nezuko.

04:49.205 --> 04:50.581
She's my little sister.

04:59.882 --> 05:01.050
Where's the fifth one?

05:04.429 --> 05:07.348
I have to find it
while Nezuko and Genya hold them off.

05:14.897 --> 05:15.773
Is that…

05:16.441 --> 05:21.195
The smell of hot spring sulfur has been
blown away thanks to the fan demon.

05:22.071 --> 05:23.448
Find it!

05:24.073 --> 05:25.199
Concentrate!

05:33.958 --> 05:37.712
It's all right. They won't find me.

05:37.795 --> 05:39.547
It's all right.

05:39.630 --> 05:44.093
The four emotions will
defeat the bad guys.

05:44.177 --> 05:45.303
Found it!

05:45.386 --> 05:47.764
There it is! I found it!

05:48.765 --> 05:49.974
Genya!

05:51.184 --> 05:52.185
Urogi!

05:54.771 --> 05:56.647
Directly northeast!

05:59.275 --> 06:01.736
The fifth one is hiding low on the ground!

06:08.284 --> 06:09.619
Genya!

06:10.078 --> 06:12.413
Go for it! I'll cover you!

06:12.497 --> 06:13.498
Northeast!

06:15.750 --> 06:18.002
Crap! He's going to use lightning again.

06:21.005 --> 06:23.174
Nezuko, help Genya!

06:23.257 --> 06:26.302
Don't let the lightning demon
interfere with Genya!

06:36.479 --> 06:37.730
Don't get blown away!

06:37.814 --> 06:39.899
I can't leave this place!

06:41.651 --> 06:44.070
Damn! He's gonna follow up
with a lightning attack!

06:56.332 --> 06:58.543
Nezuko!

07:07.301 --> 07:09.804
Is it painful?

07:09.887 --> 07:12.432
It must be painful.

07:18.646 --> 07:20.189
It's useless, isn't it?

07:23.234 --> 07:26.195
Not only won't you be able to use
your breathing technique,

07:26.279 --> 07:30.700
but you'll soon die of suffocation
in there too.

07:37.915 --> 07:42.086
It's such a pleasure to see you
trying to look nonchalant!

07:42.712 --> 07:47.216
It gets my creative juices flowing!

07:50.344 --> 07:51.554
Don't struggle.

07:51.971 --> 07:53.556
It makes me sad.

07:53.639 --> 07:54.474
Sekido.

07:55.057 --> 07:56.434
I already know!

07:56.517 --> 07:57.727
Just keep her--

08:08.112 --> 08:09.238
That kid…

08:09.947 --> 08:12.658
He's gotten even faster than before.

08:12.783 --> 08:17.538
No, even from the moment we met,
he was stronger than my lord told me.

08:17.622 --> 08:21.042
He has outstanding reflexes
and adapts to the fight.

08:26.005 --> 08:28.633
Such explosive growth at critical moments!

08:38.017 --> 08:39.227
This is bad.

08:39.769 --> 08:41.479
Karaku! Karaku!

08:44.607 --> 08:46.442
Stay right there, kiddo!

08:49.779 --> 08:53.658
Good, now that kid who shot lead bullets…

08:57.912 --> 08:59.497
I got cut.

09:00.039 --> 09:01.582
Damn you, kid!

09:01.958 --> 09:02.875
Genya!

09:02.959 --> 09:06.003
To the right! It's moving south!

09:06.087 --> 09:07.338
Look for it!

09:08.589 --> 09:12.093
That's what I'm doing!
I've been looking this whole time!

09:12.176 --> 09:13.302
Is it demon art?

09:13.386 --> 09:15.888
Am I unable to see it
because of some demon art?

09:16.472 --> 09:19.725
Shit! Shit! Shit! Where is it?

09:19.809 --> 09:23.854
The longer this goes on,
the more exhausted I get.

09:28.067 --> 09:29.527
To the west!

09:29.610 --> 09:32.905
More to your right!
It's close! On the ground!

09:33.906 --> 09:34.991
Where is it?

09:35.700 --> 09:36.534
Where--

09:36.617 --> 09:38.369
Genya, look down!

09:45.001 --> 09:46.460
It's so small!

09:50.339 --> 09:53.217
It's too small. Is that the main body?

09:53.801 --> 09:55.052
This little creep?

09:55.136 --> 09:58.222
Damn it! How was I supposed to find that?

09:58.764 --> 10:01.225
It's the size of a field mouse.

10:01.309 --> 10:03.686
The other four are so strong.

10:03.769 --> 10:06.480
And this pipsqueak is controlling them?

10:06.564 --> 10:10.443
We have to go mouse hunting
while fighting those four?

10:10.526 --> 10:12.320
What a pain in the ass!

10:12.403 --> 10:15.948
Now I see how they've killed
so many Corps members so far.

10:16.032 --> 10:18.326
You've gotta be shitting me,
you sneaky bastard!

10:18.409 --> 10:20.620
You really piss me off!

10:22.580 --> 10:24.790
I got him! I won!

10:30.546 --> 10:33.758
I can't cut him? I can't!

10:34.216 --> 10:36.385
No way!

10:36.469 --> 10:39.639
His neck is only as thick as a finger!

10:47.480 --> 10:49.190
It didn't work!

10:53.653 --> 10:56.238
Crap! I was too slow.

10:57.198 --> 10:58.783
I can't dodge.

11:00.159 --> 11:01.327
He's gonna get me.

11:02.036 --> 11:04.330
I can't regenerate my head.

11:06.248 --> 11:07.833
KILL

11:07.917 --> 11:09.585
Big bro…

11:13.214 --> 11:18.302
I wanted to be a Hashira
so he would acknowledge me.

11:19.095 --> 11:25.309
And I wanted to apologize for that time.

11:27.061 --> 11:31.982
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

11:32.066 --> 11:36.987
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

11:39.698 --> 11:44.453
My mother had a small physique.

11:45.162 --> 11:49.875
It didn't take long for me
to grow taller than her.

11:51.836 --> 11:56.257
She worked from morning till night.

11:57.341 --> 12:01.720
I never saw her sleep.

12:04.515 --> 12:08.644
My father was a big good-for-nothing.

12:09.728 --> 12:12.731
People hated him so much
that he was stabbed to death.

12:12.815 --> 12:14.233
He got what he deserved.

12:15.109 --> 12:19.530
My father often hit us and my mother.

12:21.240 --> 12:27.079
Despite her small body,
I think my mother was amazing.

12:27.163 --> 12:32.209
She never faltered in protecting us
from our monstrous father.

12:53.689 --> 12:56.192
Mom is late.

13:01.989 --> 13:04.450
Genya, you can't sleep?

13:04.533 --> 13:05.951
You too, big bro?

13:07.745 --> 13:09.914
I'm gonna go find Mom.

13:10.789 --> 13:11.707
I'll come with you.

13:11.790 --> 13:16.587
No, I'll go alone. You have to stay home.

13:20.424 --> 13:21.842
You promised, remember?

13:23.928 --> 13:24.929
Got it.

13:30.184 --> 13:31.894
I'm counting on you.

13:32.561 --> 13:33.521
Yeah.

13:45.533 --> 13:46.534
Big bro.

13:47.243 --> 13:48.244
Big bro.

13:49.036 --> 13:50.329
Big bro.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.081
Big bro.

13:54.291 --> 13:57.378
Jeez. You're all awake?

14:01.924 --> 14:04.176
Is Mom all right?

14:05.010 --> 14:09.139
She's gonna be all right.
Our big bro went to find her.

14:09.807 --> 14:11.016
But…

14:13.269 --> 14:16.772
She's never been this late before.

14:17.940 --> 14:20.192
It's nearly dawn.

14:21.026 --> 14:22.736
No need to worry.

14:22.820 --> 14:25.406
You must be tired. Go sleep.

14:25.489 --> 14:29.034
When you wake up,
Mom and big bro will have returned.

14:33.080 --> 14:34.415
It's Mom!

14:34.498 --> 14:35.666
Mom!

14:35.749 --> 14:36.876
Mom!

14:39.587 --> 14:42.631
Wait! Don't open it! It might not be Mom!

14:54.518 --> 14:56.562
Is it a beast? A stray dog?

14:56.645 --> 14:58.480
No, it's a wolf!

14:59.732 --> 15:01.275
It's so dark, I can't see.

15:02.401 --> 15:03.360
So fast!

15:04.904 --> 15:06.071
Genya, run!

15:07.281 --> 15:08.616
Big bro!

15:16.916 --> 15:17.917
Koto!

15:18.542 --> 15:19.752
Shuya!

15:20.377 --> 15:23.088
Hiroshi! Teiko! Sumi!

15:24.840 --> 15:26.258
Hold down the wound!

15:27.426 --> 15:29.303
I'll get a doctor right away!

15:29.386 --> 15:31.180
Hang in there for a while!

15:38.312 --> 15:40.648
What in the world is happening?

15:40.731 --> 15:42.983
What was that thing?

15:43.067 --> 15:44.151
Is big bro all right?

15:44.234 --> 15:46.612
No, treating everyone's wounds
is more important.

15:53.202 --> 15:54.203
Big bro…

15:58.832 --> 16:00.084
Mom!

16:02.753 --> 16:05.297
Mom! Mom!

16:05.381 --> 16:06.507
Why?

16:06.590 --> 16:10.678
Why? Why did you kill Mom?

16:13.055 --> 16:14.640
Murderer!

16:15.265 --> 16:17.935
Murderer!

16:20.938 --> 16:25.025
I'm sorry I said
such a terrible thing, big bro.

16:25.859 --> 16:31.907
I know it's just an excuse,
but I was upset at the time.

16:32.950 --> 16:37.621
Shuya, Hiroshi, Koto, Teiko
and Sumi were cold.

16:38.622 --> 16:40.124
They wouldn't respond.

16:41.834 --> 16:42.918
It was no use.

16:43.002 --> 16:46.046
I knew they were going to die.

16:47.923 --> 16:49.383
That wolf…

16:50.509 --> 16:52.678
What I thought was a wolf…

16:53.804 --> 16:56.181
It was actually Mom as a demon.

16:58.308 --> 17:01.395
Big bro fought to protect us.

17:01.478 --> 17:04.106
And when dawn began to break…

17:04.940 --> 17:10.237
When he realized that it was Mom
who had attacked our family,

17:12.031 --> 17:14.908
I wonder how he felt then.

17:16.618 --> 17:22.624
Not only was he shattered when he realized
he'd killed our beloved mother,

17:22.708 --> 17:26.336
he was berated by the younger brother
he was desperately trying to protect.

17:26.962 --> 17:29.048
I wonder how he felt.

17:31.550 --> 17:37.306
And when we'd only just promised
to protect our family together…

17:47.483 --> 17:48.484
Genya.

17:50.527 --> 17:52.738
The two of us must protect our family.

17:54.406 --> 17:56.825
Now that our father was stabbed to death.

17:56.909 --> 17:59.828
I feel a lot better without him though.

18:01.246 --> 18:05.542
But without a father figure,
everyone would feel insecure.

18:09.546 --> 18:15.677
From now on, you and I will protect
our mother and younger siblings.

18:17.346 --> 18:18.305
Understand?

18:22.893 --> 18:29.149
It's not from now on, though.
We'll do it like we always have, right?

18:31.860 --> 18:32.861
Yeah!

18:40.035 --> 18:41.662
I'm sorry, big bro.

18:42.538 --> 18:45.666
I'm going to die without ever apologizing.

18:47.835 --> 18:53.924
How come I see your smiling face
flashing in front of me before I die?

18:55.008 --> 18:58.846
Big bro, I didn't have any talent.

18:58.929 --> 19:02.850
Since I can't use a breathing technique,
I can't become a Hashira.

19:04.393 --> 19:08.105
It's hard to meet a Hashira
unless you become one.

19:08.856 --> 19:12.192
I worked so hard, but it was useless.

19:13.652 --> 19:18.031
A piece of scum like you
can't be my brother.

19:18.115 --> 19:19.867
Quit the Demon Slayer Corps.

19:21.660 --> 19:26.206
But why? I am your younger brother!

19:27.291 --> 19:28.333
Genya!

19:29.835 --> 19:31.003
Don't give up yet!

19:36.884 --> 19:38.302
Try again!

19:39.011 --> 19:40.888
Try to sever its head once more!

19:40.971 --> 19:42.514
Don't ever give up!

19:42.598 --> 19:44.183
You can do it this time!

19:44.933 --> 19:46.059
I'll protect you!

19:47.060 --> 19:49.146
Focus on severing its head!

19:50.397 --> 19:52.149
Aren't you going to be a Hashira?

19:52.691 --> 19:54.193
Genya Shinazugawa!

19:57.738 --> 19:58.739
Crap!

19:58.822 --> 19:59.823
He's behind me!

20:00.324 --> 20:02.242
Weeping Spears.

20:04.828 --> 20:08.165
Damn it, I got hit head on.

20:17.049 --> 20:18.133
Go.

20:19.301 --> 20:20.469
Genya!

20:25.432 --> 20:28.393
I can't sever its head.

20:30.437 --> 20:33.607
You do it!

20:34.942 --> 20:37.945
Just this one time, I'll…

20:39.738 --> 20:40.739
Genya…

20:45.160 --> 20:46.495
I'll let you do it!

20:58.131 --> 21:00.217
I'll definitely do it.

21:09.643 --> 21:10.686
There it is!

21:12.938 --> 21:13.814
It's so small.

21:20.320 --> 21:21.488
I won't let you escape.

23:06.009 --> 23:07.010
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC
NO. 6

23:07.844 --> 23:10.388
Genya, you haven't eaten
anything today again.

23:10.472 --> 23:11.598
Will you be all right?

23:12.140 --> 23:16.061
I heard you hadn't eaten any food
since we met at the Butterfly Mansion.

23:16.144 --> 23:18.605
If you don't eat,
you won't be able to fight the demons.

23:18.688 --> 23:19.731
That's right!

23:19.815 --> 23:21.316
I said I don't want to!

23:21.900 --> 23:24.069
Why are you always so friendly?

23:24.152 --> 23:25.070
Aren't we friends?

23:25.153 --> 23:27.072
When did we become friends?

23:27.155 --> 23:29.032
Didn't we take a bath together?

23:29.116 --> 23:30.617
It was you on your own--

23:30.700 --> 23:32.786
We entered Final Selection
in the same year.

23:32.869 --> 23:34.496
That means we're friends, right?

23:36.665 --> 23:39.126
The thing I hate about you is that--

23:39.209 --> 23:40.043
Wait a second!

23:40.127 --> 23:42.504
Next up, Episode 7: "Awful Villain."

23:42.587 --> 23:44.840
-Can't wait to work with you.
-As I was saying!

23:44.923 --> 23:45.966
TO BE CONTINUED
